---
/**
 * K Culture Wire — **차트에 오른 배우의 절반은 작품이 한 편이다.** (`/one-title`)
 *
 * ── 왜 ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
 *   「일찍 시작하면 더 멀리 가나」를 재려 했다. **한 방향으로 안 갔다**(19·11·18·7).
 *   ⛔ 억지로 읽지 않고 **왜 못 읽나**를 봤더니 그것이 이 지면이다 —
 *   ⭐ 배우 절반이 차트에 오른 작품이 한 편뿐이라, 그 사람의 「도달」은 그 작품의 도달이다.
 *
 * ── ⛔ 이 지면이 지키는 것 ────────────────────────────────────
 * ⛔ 사람을 줄세우지 않는다. **몇 편인 사람이 몇 명인가**만 낸다. 이름을 안 낸다.
 * ⛔ 「한 편뿐이니 못한 배우」로 안 읽는다. 우리가 보는 것은 넷플릭스 차트뿐이다.
 * ⚠ 음성 결과(데뷔 나이가 아무것도 안 사더라)를 **감추지 않고 같은 크기로** 낸다.
 * ⛔ 광고 자리를 만들지 않는다. Riot Production(App 866800) 승인 전이다.
 *
 * 🔴 Astro 앞말(`---` 사이)은 **TypeScript 다.** JSX 를 넣으면 빌드가 죽는다.
 */
import WikiTip from '../../layouts/WikiTip.astro';
import KcwRelatedArticles from '../../components/KcwRelatedArticles.astro';
import d from '../../data/wikitip-one-title.json';

const TITLE = 'Half of the Korean actors on a Netflix chart are there for one title';
const DESC =
  `Of ${d.actorsWithAtLeastOne.toLocaleString('en-US')} Korean actors with a title on a Netflix `
  + `country chart, ${d.oneTitleOnlyPc}% have exactly one and ${d.twoOrFewerPc}% have two or fewer. `
  + 'That is why a chart cannot measure a person: for half of them, the reach we would attribute to '
  + 'the actor is the reach of a single title.';

const jsonLd = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'Dataset',
  name: TITLE,
  description: DESC,
  creator: { '@type': 'Organization', name: 'K Culture Wire' },
  isBasedOn: ['https://www.netflix.com/tudum/top10', 'https://www.wikidata.org'],
};
---

<WikiTip title={TITLE} description={DESC} jsonLd={jsonLd}
  canonical="https://www.kculturewire.com/one-title">
  <h1>{TITLE}</h1>
  <p class="lead">{d.question}</p>
  <p class="q">
    <b>{d.oneTitleOnlyPc}%</b> of {d.actorsWithAtLeastOne.toLocaleString('en-US')} actors have
    exactly one charting title. <b>{d.twoOrFewerPc}%</b> have two or fewer.
  </p>

  <section>
    <h2>How many charting titles one actor has</h2>
    <div class="scroll-x">
      <table>
        <thead><tr><th>Charting titles</th><th>Actors</th><th>Share</th><th>Cumulative</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          {d.distribution.map((x) => (
            <tr>
              <td class="nm">{x.titles}</td>
              <td class="tot">{x.actors}</td>
              <td>{x.sharePc}%</td>
              <td class="fine">{x.cumulativePc}%</td>
            </tr>
          ))}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p class="note"><b>{d.unit}</b></p>
    <p class="warn">{d.whyReachIsNotThePersons}</p>
  </section>

  <section class="warn-box">
    <h2>What we tried to measure, and did not find</h2>
    <p class="note">
      We set out to test whether Korean actors who debut younger end up reaching more countries.
      Grouped by age at first credit, the median widest reach runs as below. It does not move in
      one direction, and it flips again when years active are held fixed.
    </p>
    <div class="scroll-x">
      <table>
        <thead><tr><th>Age at first credit</th><th>Actors</th><th>Median titles</th>
          <th>Median widest reach</th><th>Median years active</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          {d.debutBands.map((x) => (
            <tr>
              <td class="nm">{x.band}</td>
              <td class="tot">{x.actors}</td>
              <td>{x.medianTitles ?? '—'}</td>
              <td>{x.medianWidestReach ?? '—'}</td>
              <td class="fine">{x.medianYearsActive ?? '—'}</td>
            </tr>
          ))}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p class="warn">
      {d.debutAgeMonotonic
        ? 'The bands move in one direction, so debut age is worth reading here.'
        : 'The bands do not move in one direction, so we do not report debut age as buying anything. '
          + 'This page carries the negative result rather than dropping it — a measurement taken and '
          + 'not published is a measurement not taken.'}
      {' '}Bands under {d.debutBandMinimum} actors would not get a median at all.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="src">
    <h2>How this was counted, and what it cannot say</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><b>Source</b> — {d.source}</li>
      <li><b>Panel</b> — {d.actorsWithAtLeastOne.toLocaleString('en-US')} actors with at least one
        title that reached a Netflix country chart.</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="warn">{d.cannotAnswer}</p>
    <p class="note">
      <a href="/crowding">How much of a title's reach is the slot it opened in</a> ·{' '}
      <a href="/provenance">Which work is this chart row</a> · <a href="/about">How we count</a>
    </p>
  </section>

  <KcwRelatedArticles page="/one-title" />
</WikiTip>

<style>
  .warn-box { border-left: 3px solid #b45309; padding-left: 1rem; }
</style>
